    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrspBPC8-XjfMW00mhuk--eP0fxe.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a>什么，第一次听说竞业协议的存在？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="326">05:26</a>我经历了————的面试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> &nbsp;医生也有试岗哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> &nbsp;医疗行业的社保也层次不齐？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1036">17:16</a> 初入职场，你也需要大胆问！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 医疗行业的boss不聘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 如果有可能，我想做一个流动医生（但目前没可能）</span></p><span></span><p><span>骗局的背后也希望大家能够越来越清醒！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后：如果深圳有合适的医疗机构需要</span><strong><span>成熟的儿牙医生</span></strong><span>欢迎联系“</span><strong><span>呐牙医生～”抖音搜索：“呐呐呐呐呐牙”</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhzD0h3Kbjz5hn6tPeEZzQ3GJhFN.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
